Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

Machine facts:
- Primary human host is macOS; Apple Silicon is supported. Cloud agents are Linux.
- QEMU is the guest. The QEMU window is PS/2; the terminal is COM1 (`make run` uses `-serial stdio`).
- Default accel is TCG (`VIBEOS_QEMU_ACCEL=tcg`). KVM flakes PIT/sleep tests on a loaded host.
